      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>Navigate to the <strong>Ecosystem</strong> -&gt; <strong>Installed Operators</strong> page.</li>
      <li>Select the OpenShift Virtualization Operator.</li>
      <li>Click the <strong>OpenShift Virtualization Deployment</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Click the Options menu <img src="kebab.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /> beside <code>kubevirt-hyperconverged</code> and select <strong>Delete HyperConverged</strong>.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Delete</strong> in the confirmation window.</li>
      </ol>
      <h2 id="olm-deleting-operators-from-a-cluster-using-web-console_uninstalling-virt" class="group scroll-mt-20">Deleting Operators from a cluster using the web console<a href="#olm-deleting-operators-from-a-cluster-using-web-console_uninstalling-virt" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
