      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>Navigate to the <strong>Ecosystem</strong> -&gt; <strong>Installed Operators</strong> page.</li>
      <li>Scroll or enter a keyword into the <strong>Filter by name</strong> field to find the Operator that you want to remove. Then, click on it.</li>
